(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-05","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["旅店老板娘把窗帘拉上，才答应接受程雾的[[interview|访谈]]。赵启失踪那晚，她看见两个人把灰外套男子推上货车。这位[[witness|目击者]]很[[fearful|害怕]]，反复说自己没看清脸。我们也[[anxious|焦虑]]，程雾却没有催，先请她画车停的位置。老板娘画到第三条街时终于坐下，说车里的人曾抓住门框，但她当时以为是醉酒的争执。我把笔放平，免得她看见我手抖。","旧[[receipt|收据]]已经送走，我展开获准留下的照片，跟主管核对那批木材的[[shipment|装运]]。入库时间比总账提前一天，两项[[payment|付款]]分别给了货主和本地运输队，登记的[[client|客户]]却是同一家木材商。老陈把当年的转弯水道画在纸角，解释货船怎样会挡住回来的渡船。主管抄下船号去找旧值班员。我压着照片边沿，忽然明白，父亲被迫等待的那些分钟，也许正是别人赶着结算的时间。","老板娘窗边有台拍节日灯景的[[camera|相机]]，那晚没开机，手机里却存着发给妹妹的一张[[photograph|照片]]。灯笼右侧恰好露出货车后部，拍摄[[angle|角度]]太斜，看不全号码；雨夜[[visibility|能见度]]又差，只能辨出尾灯的裂缝。程雾留下原图和发送时间，没有把模糊车牌变成猜出来的数字。老板娘松开一直攥着的杯子，问，这样也能帮上忙吗？何警官说能。","老陈一眼[[recognize|认出]]那辆[[lorry|货车]]，上周司机来问过换尾灯的价钱。裂灯是个[[distinctive|鲜明的]]特征，但他仍翻遍抽屉，找出报价单上记的车牌和司机出示的运输[[license|许可证]]编号。警方核对这两项，确认车属秦衡雇用的清运队。老板娘又指向快印社那条街，说车从那里走了。两条路在纸上接到一起，我刚起身，老陈便把外套递给民警，把我的椅子往桌边推了推。","每份[[account|叙述]]都要能说清是谁看见的。照片使车辆线索更[[credible|可信]]，仍不能辨出被推上车的人。何警官去[[contact|联系]]快印社房东，继续[[pursue|追查]]租客和后院出入口。等待时，程雾借来一台经过检查的旧播放机。我端着三碗面进门，磁带里忽然响起细小的叮当声。老陈的筷子停了：‘你爸那只铁杯。船上有风，它就撞栏杆。’"],"en":["The guesthouse owner closed the curtain before agreeing to an [[interview|interview]] with Cheng. On the night Zhao vanished, she had seen two people push a man in a grey coat into a truck. The [[witness|witness]] was [[fearful|fearful]], repeating that she had not seen his face clearly. We were [[anxious|anxious]] too, but Cheng did not rush her. She first asked her to draw where the vehicle had stopped. By the third street, the woman finally sat down. The man had held the door frame, she said, but she had thought it was an argument involving drink. I laid my pen flat so she would not see my hand shake.","The old [[receipt|receipt]] had been handed over. Using a photograph we were allowed to keep, I checked the timber [[shipment|shipment]] with the supervisor. Its arrival preceded the main account entry by a day. Two [[payment|payments]] went to the owner and the local carrier, but the listed [[client|client]] was the same timber merchant. Chen drew the turning channel in a corner of the paper, explaining how the freight boat could block the returning ferry. The supervisor copied its number to ask a former duty officer. Holding down the photograph, I realized that Dad's forced waiting might have been someone else's rush to settle a bill.","The owner kept a [[camera|camera]] by her window for festival scenes. It had been off that night, but her phone held a [[photograph|photograph]] she had sent her sister. Beside the lantern it accidentally showed the truck's rear. The [[angle|angle]] hid part of the registration, and rainy-night [[visibility|visibility]] was poor; only a cracked rear light was clear. Cheng kept the original image and sending time. She did not turn a blurred plate into guessed digits. The owner released the cup she had been gripping. Could this still help, she asked. Officer He said it could.","Chen was able to [[recognize|recognize]] the [[lorry|lorry]] immediately: its driver had asked him for a rear-light replacement price the previous week. The crack was [[distinctive|distinctive]], but Chen still searched his drawers. On the quotation he had noted the registration and the transport [[license|license]] number the driver had shown him. Police checked both and confirmed that the vehicle belonged to Qin's hired clearance team. The owner pointed toward the printing-shop street, saying the truck had left that way. Two paths joined on our paper. As I rose, Chen handed his coat to the officer and pushed my chair back toward the table.","Each [[account|account]] had to make clear who had actually seen what. The photograph made the vehicle lead more [[credible|credible]], but did not identify the man pushed aboard. Officer He went to [[contact|contact]] the printing shop's landlord and [[pursue|pursue]] the tenants and rear entrances. While we waited, Cheng borrowed an old player that had been checked. I came in with three bowls of noodles just as a small metallic clink sounded from the tape. Chen's chopsticks stopped. 'Your dad's iron cup. The wind made it knock against the rail.'"]});
